Output:

5

Step 8. Aggregation – Stock summary per category

db.products.aggregate([
  {
    $match: {
      price: { $gte: 500 }
    }
  },
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$category",
      totalStock: { $sum: "$stock" },
      avgPrice: { $avg: "$price" }
    }
  },
  {
    $sort: {
      totalStock: -1
    }
  },
  {
    $project: {
      _id: 0,
      category: "$_id",
      totalStock: 1,
      avgPrice: 1
    }
  }
])

Expected output

[
  {
    category: "Accessories",
    totalStock: 105,
    avgPrice: 1100
  },
  {
    category: "Computers",
    totalStock: 25,
    avgPrice: 33500
  }
]

Important: $match filters, $group calculates, $sum adds, $avg calculates average, and $sort: -1 sorts in descending order.

